    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "SurroundingArea",
      "text": "With a stay at Sidney Hotel London Victoria, you\u0027ll be centrally located in London, within a 5-minute drive of Westminster Abbey and Buckingham Palace.  This hotel is 0.5 mi (0.8 km) from Victoria Station Travel Information Centre and 1.2 mi (1.9 km) from Big Ben."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RoomTypes",
      "text": "Stay in one of 80 guestrooms featuring LCD televisions. Satellite programming provides entertainment, and wired and wireless internet access is available for a surcharge. Private bathrooms with bathtubs feature complimentary toiletries and hair dryers. Conveniences include phones, as well as safes and desks."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PropertyInformation",
      "text": "Make use of convenient amenities such as wireless internet access (surcharge), concierge services, and a television in a common area. Additional amenities at this hotel include discounted use of a nearby fitness facility and a reception hall."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "AreaActivities",
      "text": "Distances are displayed to the nearest 0.1 mile and kilometer. \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003Cp\u003EApollo Victoria Theatre - 0.7 km / 0.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Victoria Station Travel Information Centre - 0.8 km / 0.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E St. James Park - 1.5 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Buckingham Palace - 1.5 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Westminster Abbey - 1.5 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Green Park - 1.6 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Houses of Parliament - 1.6 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Sloane Square - 1.7 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E The Oval - 1.8 km / 1.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Hyde Park Corner - 1.8 km / 1.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Big Ben - 1.9 km / 1.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Park Lane - 1.9 km / 1.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Hyde Park - 1.9 km / 1.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Westminster Bridge - 2 km / 1.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Battersea Power Station - 2 km / 1.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe nearest airports are:\u003Cbr /\u003ELondon City Airport (LCY) - 17 km / 10.5 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Heathrow Airport (LHR) - 26.8 km / 16.6 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Gatwick Airport (LGW) - 65.1 km / 40.5 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Luton Airport (LTN) - 55.6 km / 34.5 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe preferred airport for Sidney Hotel London Victoria is Heathrow Airport (LHR). \u003C/p\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PoliciesDisclaimers",
      "text": "\u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EExtra-person charges may apply and vary depending on property policy\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGovernment-issued photo identification and a credit card may be required at check-in for incidental charges\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpecial requests are subject to availability upon check-in and may incur additional charges; special requests cannot be guaranteed\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMinimum Spring Break check-in age is 18 years old\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis property accepts credit cards\u003C/li\u003E  \u003C/ul\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "DiningFacilities",
      "text": "At Sidney Hotel London Victoria, enjoy a satisfying meal at the restaurant. Wrap up your day with a drink at the bar/lounge. A complimentary buffet breakfast is served daily from 7:30 AM to 9 AM."
    }
